Searching for AV system troubleshooting usually assumes a technician already sorted it, or a permanently installed office system you own. Neither describes the situation this guide is actually for: you rented one of our packages, no technician is on site, and something has stopped working the way it did when our crew left.

Our [technical support for events](/blog/technical-support-for-events/) and [AV technician hire](/blog/av-technician-hire/) guides already cover the other scenario in depth: what our crew does when a technician is part of your booking. This page is specifically for the packages where no one is watching the levels for you, the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/), and the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) if you did not add the technician option. What to check yourself, package by package, before you assume anything is actually broken.

[Book now](/packages/) and confirm which of our packages puts you in charge of running the equipment.

